import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 153 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 153 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","no":153,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","World-Creation Realm","Myriad Races","Five Genealogies","Differentiation"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","12-Life Cycle System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0153_模块1-创世境-万族差异化修炼体系.md","filePath":"en/0153_模块1-创世境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"}'),r={name:"en/0153_模块1-创世境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"};function n(s,e,l,d,c,u){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-153-world-creation-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" tabindex="-1">Entry 153 | World-Creation Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-153-world-creation-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 153 | World-Creation Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 50, 12</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-ten-thousand-races-ten-thousand-worlds" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Ten thousand races, ten thousand worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-ten-thousand-races-ten-thousand-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Ten thousand races, ten thousand worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s World-Creation Realm is, in the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), &quot;creating a complete world in an isolated space and designing its foundational laws.&quot; When this task falls into different life forms&#39; hands, the worlds created will be completely different. Per the five-genealogy division of the Myriad Races Genealogy Overview (Document 50), the same &quot;world creation&quot; gives birth to carbon-based, energy, mechanical, consciousness, and fused myriad world forms. This entry dissects genealogy by genealogy the World-Creation Realm&#39;s differentiated cultivation system.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text show astonishing inclusiveness here: the republican axiom of Myriad Races recognizes that &quot;worlds&quot; are not only human imagination forms; the anti-predation axiom requires each race&#39;s creation to be incremental development; the collective ascension axiom requires each race&#39;s world experience to be relayed back network-wide; causal self-discipline and law-first require no matter which kind of world, it is self-consistent and does not overstep. Per the Life Cycle System (Document 12), unfolding the five genealogies&#39; creation differences. Among them, Article 6 the universal equal infinite law establishes the origin logic that all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, and predation loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-carbon-based-material-races-ecological-worlds" tabindex="-1">I. Carbon-Based Material Races: Ecological Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-carbon-based-material-races-ecological-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Carbon-Based Material Races: Ecological Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Humans, wood tribe, beast tribe, scaled tribe, feathered tribe creating worlds naturally lean toward <strong>matter-ecology worlds</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Humans</strong>: designing social-type worlds containing civilizational collaboration, emphasizing beings&#39; autonomy</li><li><strong>Wood tribe</strong>: world creation is creating a &quot;living forest world,&quot; the entire world itself is a super-life; ecological self-cycle is its substrate law</li><li><strong>Beast/feathered/scaled tribes</strong>: creation often includes free migration and wild-balance laws, avoiding designing the world as a greenhouse</li><li>Advantage: life cycle within the world is most natural, highest habitability</li></ul><p>The carbon-based races&#39; unique contribution is providing Myriad Races with &quot;habitable, reproducible&quot; physical world fields.</p><h2 id="ii-energy-condensation-races-law-worlds" tabindex="-1">II. Energy Condensation Races: Law Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-energy-condensation-races-law-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Energy Condensation Races: Law Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Spirit tribe, fire tribe, water tribe, wind tribe, thunder tribe creating worlds lean toward <strong>energy-law worlds</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Spirit tribe</strong>: can create &quot;pure law worlds,&quot; minimal matter layer, extremely exquisite law layer, suited for advanced cultivator deduction</li><li><strong>Fire/water/wind/thunder tribes</strong>: creating distinctly attributed elemental worlds, becoming dedicated dojos for corresponding cultivators</li><li>Advantage: extremely high law self-consistency, natural laboratory for law engineering research</li><li>Difficulty: if the world must hold carbon-based life, an extra energy buffer layer is needed</li></ul><p>Energy tribes&#39; worlds are mostly &quot;cultivation resources&quot; — precisely one of the three uses of created worlds described in Document 14.</p><h2 id="iii-mechanical-construction-races-precision-worlds" tabindex="-1">III. Mechanical Construction Races: Precision Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-mechanical-construction-races-precision-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Mechanical Construction Races: Precision Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Machine tribe, number tribe, crystal tribe creating worlds lean toward <strong>calculation-construction worlds</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Machine tribe</strong>: creating &quot;mechanical civilization worlds,&quot; laws run by engineering logic, the steadiest, least collapsing worlds among Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Number tribe</strong>: can directly create &quot;digital worlds/information worlds,&quot; the world itself is a runnable huge program, suited for simulation review and consciousness habitation</li><li><strong>Crystal tribe</strong>: creating &quot;crystal energy-storage worlds,&quot; energy circulates and amplifies infinitely within, a rare high-dimensional energy field</li><li>Advantage: engineerable, replicable, verifiable, zero design defects</li><li>Difficulty: somewhat &quot;hard&quot; for life needing emotion and chaotic creativity</li></ul><p>Mechanical tribes&#39; precision worlds provide infrastructure for the Multiverse Realm&#39;s (from Entry 164) cross-cosmos information interconnection.</p><h2 id="iv-consciousness-information-races-dream-worlds" tabindex="-1">IV. Consciousness Information Races: Dream Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consciousness-information-races-dream-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consciousness Information Races: Dream Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dream tribe, shadow tribe, thought tribe, soul tribe creating worlds lean toward <strong>consciousness-information worlds</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Dream tribe</strong>: can create &quot;dream worlds,&quot; carrying Myriad Races&#39; consciousness cultivation and collective subconscious exploration</li><li><strong>Shadow/thought tribes</strong>: creating &quot;hidden/thought worlds,&quot; suited for non-destructive consciousness research under causal self-discipline requirements</li><li><strong>Soul tribe</strong>: creating &quot;consciousness resting worlds,&quot; providing safe habitation for life needing consciousness transition</li><li>Difficulty: the boundary between consciousness worlds and real consciousness fields must be strictly isolated, otherwise causal pollution</li><li>Value: the Quest Sediment Domain, Youth Supreme subplots, and soul-spirit resting all depend on such worlds</li></ul><p>Consciousness tribes&#39; worlds are the &quot;invisible yet most precision&quot; kind, deeply bound to the causal self-discipline axiom.</p><h2 id="v-hybrid-variation-races-fusion-worlds" tabindex="-1">V. Hybrid Variation Races: Fusion Worlds <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-hybrid-variation-races-fusion-worlds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Hybrid Variation Races: Fusion Worlds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Half-beast tribe, demon-spirit tribe, human-machine tribe, dual-soul entities creating worlds often build <strong>cross-genealogy fusion worlds</strong>:</p><ul><li>Human-machine tribe creates &quot;physical + digital&quot; dual-layer worlds, the most popular composite world field in recent years</li><li>Dual-soul entities creating worlds must first complete dual-soul coordination certification (Document 58), avoiding world substrate logic splitting</li><li>Hybrid world scale continues to expand with Myriad Races fusion, itself a living specimen of Myriad Races republicanism</li></ul><h2 id="vi-differentiated-creation-assessment-under-unified-standards" tabindex="-1">VI. Differentiated Creation Assessment Under Unified Standards <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-differentiated-creation-assessment-under-unified-standards" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Differentiated Creation Assessment Under Unified Standards&quot;">​</a></h2><p>No matter the genealogy, world-creation certification returns to Document 14&#39;s hard metrics: complete world, self-consistent laws, life seeding, autonomously runnable. But the connotation of &quot;complete world&quot; is customized by genealogy — wood tribe&#39;s completeness is ecological self-cycle, number tribe&#39;s completeness is program self-run, dream tribe&#39;s completeness is consciousness self-consistency. This &quot;unified standard, ten thousand world forms&quot; design is precisely the redemption of the 99% Myriad Races coverage in the World-Creation Realm.</p><h2 id="vii-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VII. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: each race&#39;s creation talent is channeled to the world type it is best at, none forced to create &quot;a world good in others&#39; eyes&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: each race&#39;s world is newly built increment, not swallowing and remodeling existing planes</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system strong ones&#39; worlds were mostly &quot;human/dragon centered&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five genealogies each create their own worlds, coexisting equally</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five genealogies fully covered, world forms vary by race, absolutely no &quot;standard-answer world&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: each race&#39;s creation experience is all relayed back to the anchor network, cross-genealogy learners can borrow wood tribe ecology methods, number tribe program methods</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The World-Creation Realm&#39;s Myriad Races differences show there is no single template for a &quot;good world.&quot; Wood tribe&#39;s forests, number tribe&#39;s programs, dream tribe&#39;s dreams, human tribe&#39;s societies — as long as the life inside can live equally and freely, it is a good world. Myriad Races each create their own worlds, then relay experience back to the same network, and the cosmos truly becomes rich.</p><p>In the final analysis, the World-Creation Realm Myriad Race differentiated cultivation system described in this document is no isolated case — always pointing toward the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s co-building direction; its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable; law self-consistency is backstopped by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a> · <a href="./12-生命循环体系详解.html">12-Life Cycle System</a> · <a href="./58-双魂伦理准则.html">58-Dual-Soul Ethics Code</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const f=i(r,[["render",n]]);export{m as __pageData,f as default};
